{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18928","headline":"门下相公荣加册命天下同欢忝沐眷私辄感申贺 · 刘禹锡","name":"门下相公荣加册命天下同欢忝沐眷私辄感申贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"册命出宸衷，官仪自古崇。\n特膺平土拜，光赞格天功。\n再佩扶阳印，常乘鲍氏骢。\n七贤遗老在，犹得咏清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}